"id": 704380, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scf3i4.jpg"}], "slug": "jester-street-card-counting-trainer", "storyline": "Take control of the Game: Pause, Resume, see all Previous Cards, their Card Count Value, the Running & True Count; all in order to 'keep the count' -providing an advantage to the Player (when to bet BIG!).\n\nThe game of Blackjack will consist of (various) amounts of Decks, & knowing the current Running Count will enable you to calculate these best strategic betting points. See Utilities below for more info.", "summary": "Welcome to Jester Street, England. Hidden from sight, a small laundrette holds a large secret... A unique, sophisticated card-counting machine, intended to help tip the balance back into the 'common' Player's odds.\n\nAvid Player's drop in to test and perfect their Blackjack (card counting): timings, count(s), and amounts. Locals get priority access! 'Come try your skills....", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/jester-street-card-counting-trainer", "videos": [{"id": 62654, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "OYTKPW9UR8g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OYTKPW9UR8g", "title": "Jester Street : Card Counting Trainer (Coming Soon to Steam)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OYTKPW9UR8g/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}